@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = replace-with-access-token
@customerId = 1
@stockDeliveryId = 1

### Unsaved draft: regular costs, recurring DMT, pallets and call-off freight follow the selected deliveries
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/draft/from-selection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "deliveries": [{"type": "DeliveryFromStock", "id": {{stockDeliveryId}}}],
  "orderCostIds": []
}

### Separate pallets delivered through today (customer must invoice pallets separately)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/draft/from-selection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "invoiceMode": "palletsNow"
}

### Separate pallets on future deliveries
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/draft/from-selection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "invoiceMode": "palletsFuture"
}

### Inventory preview only; does not persist rows or mark deliveries as invoiced
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/accounting-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "invoiceRows": [{"priceTypeId": 1, "deliveryFromStockId": {{stockDeliveryId}}, "nrOf": 2000}]
}

### Unknown stock delivery returns 400 with a visible validation message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/accounting-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "invoiceRows": [{"priceTypeId": 1, "deliveryFromStockId": 2147483647, "nrOf": 2000}]
}
